<title>USA: First Union, Maher &amp; Co in services pact.</title>
<headline>First Union, Maher &amp; Co in services pact.</headline>
<dateline>SUMMIT, N.J. 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>First Union Corp said Tuesday it formed a partnership with Thomas J. Maher &amp; Co Inc to provide mortgage and real estate services to its customers in the mid-Atlantic region.</p>
<p>The company said the new venture, called First Union/Maher Partners, will offer customers commercial mortgage and real estate services through its relationships with insurance companies and pension funds.</p>
<p>Maher &amp; Co, a privately-owned, Pennslyvania-based commercial mortgage banking firm, currently manages more than $500 million in commercial mortgages, First Union said.</p>
